{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39710","headline":"寄罗郎中隐 · 黄滔","name":"寄罗郎中隐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"休向中兴雪至冤，钱塘江上看涛翻。\n三徵不起时贤议，九转终成道者言。\n绿酒千杯肠已烂，新诗数首骨犹存。\n瑶蟾若使知人事，仙桂应遭蠹却根。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39710.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39710","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}